{"4115040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infini Orbis", "steam_appid": 4115040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/4184357c584c2c7b7b922db6eb4db7ce.webp?t=1787488936\" width=200 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated galaxy, warping between star systems filled with unique planets, asteroid fields, and mysterious system-wide modifiers that change the rules of the game. Push towards the glaxy core to unravel more events, all while staying one step ahead of the pursuing Galactic Horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  ____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e1a590bd9aadd5e6320f54288cb34ebd.webp?t=1787488936\" width=200 height=35 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/52f67666057b5811e86e8d52cc1747da.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/52f67666057b5811e86e8d52cc1747da.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/52f67666057b5811e86e8d52cc1747da.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the resources you find by deploying fleets of automated mining drones and specialized mining ships. Establish fully automated crafting chains and profitable trade routes to build your industrial empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But these riches are rarely undefended. Prepare to guard your mining operations from scavengers drawn to your activity and conquer hostile planets to exploit the valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  ____________________________________________________________________________<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/042040b4ae09c0624d506e660de2b94f.webp?t=1787488936\" width=180 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/fb2d2839e613a861a66865cc0bb8a4fc.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/fb2d2839e613a861a66865cc0bb8a4fc.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/fb2d2839e613a861a66865cc0bb8a4fc.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your power by researching technologies and unlocking powerful upgrades. Use your resources to build, and customize a fleet of combat, support  and drone ships. Equip your vessels with a vast array of weapons, each with randomized rarities and game-changing stat modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">____________________________________________________________________________    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a5a4e58e84dffc329c513834a29fb533.webp?t=1787488936\" width=270 height=35 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate the hostile forces that stand in your way. Command your custom fleets in real-time tactical combat, level up your command abilities to unlock potent rewards, and upgrade your equipment to turn the tide against an overwhelming enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Horde is relentless, their pursuit tireless. Every jump buys you precious time—time to research, to build, to become stronger. Can you transform a single ship into a beacon of survival before the darkness consumes all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/4184357c584c2c7b7b922db6eb4db7ce.webp?t=1787488936\" width=200 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/24746b3a96bd1a2df4fb6d6672807b0f.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated galaxy, warping between star systems filled with unique planets, asteroid fields, and mysterious system-wide modifiers that change the rules of the game. Push towards the glaxy core to unravel more events, all while staying one step ahead of the pursuing Galactic Horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  ____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/e1a590bd9aadd5e6320f54288cb34ebd.webp?t=1787488936\" width=200 height=35 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo