\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your power by researching technologies and unlocking powerful upgrades. Use your resources to build, and customize a fleet of combat, support  and drone ships. Equip your vessels with a vast array of weapons, each with randomized rarities and game-changing stat modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">____________________________________________________________________________    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/a5a4e58e84dffc329c513834a29fb533.webp?t=1787488936\" width=270 height=35 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.poster.avif?t=1787488936\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.webm?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115040/extras/619e83baef22ef7837996a680a66553a.mp4?t=1787488936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate the hostile forces that stand in your way. Command your custom fleets in real-time tactical combat, level up your command abilities to unlock potent rewards, and upgrade your equipment to turn the tide against an overwhelming enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Horde is relentless, their pursuit tireless. Every jump buys you precious time—tim